Our solution integrates with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI) via API connectors, supporting health interoperability standards (HL7/FHIR), the national health identifier (INS), and the national framework (Ségur du numérique en santé, Mon espace santé/DMP). We have a delivery partner, Ligeo Santé, aligned with the Ségur / Mon espace santé–DMP framework.

We guarantee strict compliance with the GDPR, including Art. 9 special-category data and Art. 28 processing agreements, as well as medical confidentiality and the HDS framework. Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud, holds the French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, ensuring that our infrastructure meets the necessary standards for hosting health data in France. We ensure data minimization, configurable retention, and tenant isolation with strict separation between client corpora.

Atelier provides features such as grounded-in-sources information, retrieval trace, audit log, and support for a posteriori review, enabling understanding of the elements that led to an output. Our secure software development lifecycle (SDLC) includes code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external CREST-equivalent provider.

